            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Allrecipes Member"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I absolutely love this recipe. I added some generous dashes of a cinnamon/sugar mix into the berry mix and it made it even better (I made two pies, one w/out the cinnamon mix and one with. The cinnamon one was better!) I also followed this recipe with wild blueberries and it's a winner every time!",
